   "source": [
    "# A4S Evaluation - Monotonicity Metric Implementation\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the implementation and evaluation of the Monotonicity metric for CIFAR-10 image classification. The metric measures whether increasing feature attribution scores lead to increasing model confidence."
   ]
  },
  {
